            100.0,
            100.0,
            100.0
          ]
        ]
      },
      "edge": false,
      "hand_check": "R. C. Gonzalez & R. E. Woods, Digital Image Processing (textbook), spatial filtering: weights sum to 1 -> 100 wherever the kernel fits (map must-reproduce); valid output 3x3"
